# CatDex — API

## Server

- Runtime: Hono in `server/src/index.ts` (default port **8787**)
- Primary route: `POST /analyze-cat`
- Also: health, privileged ops (e.g. account delete) as implemented
- Deploy target historically: Render (`docs/RENDER_DEPLOYMENT.md`)

## Client

- `analyzeCatPhoto` in `src/lib/api.ts`
- Base URL: `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` or discovery via `apiUrl.ts`
- Default remote fallback: `https://catdex-api.onrender.com` (keep HTTPS in prod)
- Send Supabase access token when session exists

## Contract rules

- JSON envelopes should stay consistent; surface server error messages through catalog mapping
- Timeouts / cold starts: analysis UI already crawls progress — don’t fake 100% before response
- Version breaking Vision fields intentionally; document in PR + `VISION_ANALYSIS.md` if user-visible

## Local dev

- Run server with `OPENAI_API_KEY` in `server/.env`
- Point app at `http://localhost:8787` only when the server is up; otherwise use remote
